    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "어이없어 말이 안 나왔다",
      "text": "I was speechless[struck dumb] with <b>amazement</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그들은 놀란 나머지 입을 딱 벌리고 나를 바라보았다.",
      "text": "They gaped at me in utter <b>amazement</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그 말을 듣자 그녀는 놀라서 눈이 둥그레졌다",
      "text": "When she heard that, she opened her eyes wide in <b>amazement</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "어린애가 그런 소리를 하다니 기막혔다",
      "text": "I was (struck) dumb with <b>amazement</b> to hear a child say such a thing."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그는 말이 안 나올 정도로 대경실색했다",
      "text": "He was speechless with <b>amazement</b>. or He was struck dumb with <b>amazement</b>. or He was dumbfounded."
    }
